NAME
    interrupts - Read permitted interrupt-controller and dispatch information.

SYNOPSIS
    interrupts | irq | irqs [status|types|vectors|cpus]

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Runs as an isolated userland command and issues Get(command.interrupts.get). The kernel returns only interrupt information permitted to the calling process. This command does not start, stop, pause or resume interrupt machinery.

ALIASES
    irq,irqs

FILES
    /System/Commands/INTRPTS.CMD
    /INU/HELP/INTRPTS.MAN
